## VIBE Teacher
For requests to explain, tour, map, review, score or improve this codebase (or "is my app safe?",
"what does this file do?", "what happens when I click…"), use the `vibe-teacher` agent skill.
Answer in plain English with tables and cards, cite file:line, mask secrets, and don't edit code
unless the user says "apply".
